  "title": "Seven Weeks",
  "summary": "Kieran admits he has known since June. Josh sends a real apology: he has called Gambler's Help and self-excluded. Mia tells him she's glad — and that she is calling off the wedding, not because he gambled but because he managed her for a year instead of telling her. She cancels the venue, tells the wedding party with kindness, separates their finances and keeps Lauren.",
