        {
          "kind": "timestamp",
          "id": "t01",
          "label": "Thu 1:12 AM"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m01",
          "sender": "josh",
          "text": "I can't sleep. I've written this ten times."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m02",
          "sender": "josh",
          "text": "no excuses. I lied to you every day for a year. I lied when you asked me straight. I took money we saved together and money from my sister, and I moved our wedding without asking you and told you it was a glitch."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m03",
          "sender": "josh",
          "text": "I called Gambler's Help today. I've got an intake call Friday. I've self-excluded from every app."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m04",
          "sender": "josh",
          "text": "what I said about everyone knowing was the worst thing I've ever said to you. I'm sorry."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m05",
          "sender": "josh",
          "text": "I love you. please don't call it off. we can do the wednesday, small, just family, and I'll spend every day earning it back"
        },
        {
          "kind": "timestamp",
          "id": "t02",
          "label": "Thu 7:40 AM"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m06",
          "sender": "mia",
          "text": "I'm glad you called them. Please keep going, whatever happens with us."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m07",
          "sender": "mia",
          "text": "I'm not calling it off because you gambled. I'm calling it off because you looked at me every day for a year and managed me instead of telling me."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m08",
          "sender": "mia",
          "text": "I'd be marrying someone I just met. I can't do that in seven weeks."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m09",
          "sender": "josh",
          "text": "mia please"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m10",
          "sender": "mia",
          "text": "I'm staying at Mum's. Let's talk about the flat next week, with someone else in the room.",
          "receipt": {
            "status": "read",
            "at": "7:46 AM"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m11",
          "sender": "josh",
          "text": "ok"
        }
      ],
      "meta": {
        "beat": "The decision."
      }
